# RTC 首期服务目录模板。两机地址来自用户确认，具体节点必须按实际 Docker 清单补齐。
# RTC/Agent: 111.230.192.59
# 中心/API/UI/Demo: 111.230.108.76
# nodes 为空表示尚未建立节点基线，应返回 UNKNOWN，不能作为已纳管或已验收配置。
# 填入节点时使用精确容器名；核心单点 restart_enabled 默认 false，研发确认后开放。
schema_version: 1
site:
  code: rtc-pilot
  name: RTC 监控试点
clusters:
  - code: rtc-pilot
    name: RTC 首期试点
    product: RTC
    services:
      - code: rtc-ap
        name: RTC AP
        nodes: []
      - code: rtc-balancer
        name: RTC Balancer
        nodes: []
      - code: rtc-native-edge-udp
        name: RTC Native Edge UDP
        nodes: []
      - code: rtc-native-edge-aut
        name: RTC Native Edge AUT
        nodes: []
      - code: rtc-web-edge
        name: RTC Web Edge
        nodes: []
